  },
  "question": {
    "en": "9. Examiner: (1) debriefs with caregiver using the FCM debriefing script at the end of the activity and (2) checks in to see if caregiver has any questions about the activities and responds as apprioriate, before wrapping up with caregiver. Score as '1' if both criteria are met; score as '0' if one or more is missed."
  },
